# Claude Code sandbox /dev/null bind-mount artifacts — character device nodes
# bind-mounted over host shell/tool/editor config inside every worktree. Not
# repo content and not committable (git cannot stage a character device); listed
# here only to keep `git status` clean. Not every entry is a device, though:
# measured unsandboxed 2026-08-31, .claude/agents is a REGULAR empty file
# (mode 0444, no mountinfo entry) that the session harness drops in each
# checkout — it presents as a character device only through the sandbox
# overlay. So it is genuinely stageable, and one `git add -A` really would
# commit it; that is why it is listed. Caveat: .gitmodules, .mcp.json,
# .claude/agents, and .claude/commands are names this repo could legitimately
# track in the future — .claude/agents is where project subagent definitions
# would live — so a real file at one of those paths needs a one-time
# `git add -f`.
/.bash_profile
/.bashrc
/.profile
/.zprofile
/.zshrc
/.gitconfig
/.ripgreprc
/.gitmodules
/.mcp.json
/.claude/agents
/.claude/commands
/.claude/launch.json
/.claude/routines
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
/.claude/loop.md
/.claude/output-styles
/.idea
/.vscode

# dispatch-review-erosion temp dirs (cleaned up by trap, but excluded if SIGKILL)
.erosion-baseline.*

# recovery-drill raw JSON archives (ops/recovery-drills/github-export.sh) — large
# per-run API dumps; only the summary archives-manifest.json is committed.
ops/recovery-drills/archives/
.erosion-jscpd-head.*
.erosion-jscpd-base.*

# design-sync (claude.ai/design) — transient build/verify state. The durable
